# Line endings for the fixtures that tests compare BYTE FOR BYTE.
#
# tests/test_stage1_oracle.py regenerates tests/fixtures/tokenizer_expected_ids.tsv
# and asserts the result equals the committed file byte for byte. The generator
# writes LF (reference/stage1_oracle.py, newline="\n") and the committed blobs are
# LF, but this machine has core.autocrlf=true, so a checkout rewrites the working
# copy to CRLF and the comparison then fails on a file nobody edited. Marking the
# fixtures eol=lf makes the checked-out bytes the committed bytes.
*.tsv text eol=lf
